  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You are a hiring manager at Synergix Global Solutions. Every day you have
    one position to fill.


    <b>1. Review.</b> Read the resume, the hiring manual
    and the reference letter. Click a detail to mark it as a red flag or as good.
    Your marks are added to your Notes.


    <b>2. Call.</b> You can phone a reference,
    but you only get 2 calls for the whole game.


    <b>3. Interview.</b> Ask up
    to 3 questions, then call out anything that does not add up.


    <b>4. Decide.</b>
    Hire or reject. You have 60 seconds per applicant, then 10 seconds to choose.


    Hire
    well over 5 days. Who you hire decides how the company ends up.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
